# People — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Path ids below are placeholders — replace with real ids from a list call.
@changeRequest = 1
@employee = 1
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of People operations: /api/docs (tag "People").

### GET /api/people — Directory tier only, for every active user
GET {{host}}/api/people
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### POST /api/people — people.store
POST {{host}}/api/people
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "full_name": "Example full name",
    "hired_at": "2026-10-01"
}

### GET /api/people/org-chart — ?mine=1 — the caller's own subtree (a manager's team); ?root_id — any subtree; ?branch_id
GET {{host}}/api/people/org-chart
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

